# 📂 Projects

## Cisco Packet Tracer Labs

These projects demonstrate my practical networking knowledge while completing the Cisco Networking Academy curriculum.

### ✔ Basic Network Configuration
- Configured PCs and switches
- Assigned IPv4 addresses
- Verified connectivity using ICMP

### ✔ VLAN Configuration
- Created VLANs
- Assigned switch ports
- Configured trunk links
- Verified VLAN communication

### ✔ Static Routing
- Configured routers
- Added static routes
- Verified end-to-end connectivity

### ✔ DHCP Configuration
- Configured DHCP pools
- Assigned automatic IP addresses
- Verified DHCP leases

### ✔ Access Control Lists (ACL)
- Implemented Standard ACLs
- Restricted network traffic
- Tested permitted and denied connections

### ✔ Network Troubleshooting
- Diagnosed connectivity issues
- Corrected IP addressing errors
- Fixed VLAN misconfigurations
- Restored communication

